  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-05-06T18:25:33.004Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We all have been there - we've found someone who makes exclusively avatars that offend us on a deep, personal level. Instead of clicking \"hide avatar\" on everyone using them, or clicking the proposed \"hide this avatar on everyone\" on every single avatar (https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/blocking-specific-avatars), let us hide everything that some disagreeable creator made.\nNaturally, the \"show avatar\" button would override it.\nIdeally it would come with an easy way to export/import those block lists, so that community-made \"bad avatar\" lists could be a thing, like uBlock filter lists. \nI'm sure many users would greatly appreciate never having to see yet another <specific avatar type> ever again.",
